SUMMARY:October Songwriting Cohort
DESCRIPTION:Want to see exceptional growth in your songwriting and performing this fall and have a great time doing it? Come with songs you’ve already written\, an album in progress\, half-finished ones\, or NONE AT ALL. We’ve go the perfect mix of songwriting\, craft sessions\, and 1:1 lessons to spark the momentum you crave\, fueled by the magic of individual and group support. Visit www.supernovasupport/october-songwriter-cohort for schedule details and sign up.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/october-songwriting-cohort/
LOCATION:CA
CATEGORIES:Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/newOctober2026-Cohort-flyer.png
END:VEVENT
