SUMMARY:Restorative Group Reiki Experience
DESCRIPTION:Experience the synergy of channeled sound and advanced frequency technology in a setting designed for deep restoration. \nCLICK HERE TO REGISTER WITH DANA VALLEY \n\n\nThis is a monthly gathering on the second Sunday  \nEach session offers a unique energetic transmission tuned to the group. \n\n\n\n\nJoin us each month for a deeply calming group Reiki session designed to support nervous system regulation\, energetic balance\, and deep meaningful rest. \nThis guided two-hour experience offers space to pause from the pace of daily life and simply receive. You’ll begin with gentle grounding to help you settle into your body\, followed by an extended period of hands-off Reiki as you rest comfortably. \nNo prior experience with Reiki is needed. This gathering is open to all who are seeking calm\, clarity\, and renewal. \nHeld in the calming environment of the Energy Wave Center\, this experience beautifully complements the center’s frequency-based technology—enhancing integration\, release\, and whole-body healing. \nThe small group setting allows for personal attention and a deeply connected experience. \nThis is designed for anyone seeking to relax\, recharge\, and reconnect with their natural sense of balance. You’ll leave feeling more centered\, spacious\, and reset. \n\n\n\n\nLimited to 14 participants \n• Please bring anything that helps you feel comfortable (water\, blanket\, eye pillow) \nSpace is intentionally limited to maintain an intimate and supportive environment. \n  \n\nABOUT DANA VALLEY\, Usui Reiki Master Teacher \nDana is a Usui Reiki Master Teacher and Certified Health and Wellness Coach who guides individuals and groups in energy healing and personal transformation. She blends Reiki with shamanic journeying\, mind-body medicine\, and Dagara divination\, integrating her training as a Center for Mind-Body Medicine Facilitator to support relaxation\, insight\, and healing. \nAn initiated Dagara diviner and shrine keeper\, Dana honors the lineage of Malidoma Somé and the ancestral teachings of the Dagara people of Burkina Faso. \nDana leads Reiki and energy work sessions\, as well as divinations and spiritual guidance. She can be contacted for questions or to schedule via her website: Dana Valley
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/restorative-group-reiki-experience/2026-10-11/
LOCATION:Energy Wave Center\, 120 PLeasant Hill Ave. N\, Suite 330\, Sebastopol\, 95472
CATEGORIES:All Ages (Family friendly),Health,Participatory,Spiritual
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/DANA-VALLEY-SEBTIMES-PROMO-900x425-1.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Energy Wave Center":MAILTO:connect@energywavecenter.com
END:VEVENT
