SUMMARY:Songs for Creative Revolution
DESCRIPTION:Join four Bay Area singer-songwriters\, Karen Joy Brown and Katie Phillips\, former bandmates of Sonoma County’s beloved Bootleg Honeys\, along with Bridget Boyle and Joni Davis for an afternoon of original songs that beautifully sing the unsayable\, and unapologetically confront internal and external obstacles to personal and artistic freedom. This “All Songs Considered” style performance and discussion explores the stories and creative process behind the songs. A unique songwriter-in-the-round experience that will leave listeners feeling inspired and empowered to incite their own creative revolution.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/songs-for-creative-revolution-2/
LOCATION:282 S High St\, Sebastopol\, CA 95472\, 282 S High St\, Sebastopol\, CA 95472
CATEGORIES:Adults and teens,Music
ORGANIZER;CN="supernova support":MAILTO:hello@supernovasupport.com
END:VEVENT
