DESCRIPTION:Join a cadre of enthusiastic volunteers in preserving and maintaining the Luther Burbank Experiment Farm every Wednesday from 9am to noon. We need volunteers across the spectrum of gardening\, leading tours\, showing people around the cottage\, selling items at the cottage gift shop\, and more! All skill and ability levels welcome.
