SUMMARY:Ultimate Apple Trolley Experience at Gold Ridge Organic Farms
DESCRIPTION:If you have been waiting for the perfect moment to ride our Apple Trolley\, this is it. \nSavor the beauty of the changing seasons on a scenic farm tour that takes you beyond the ride. \nDuring this special experience\, you will learn more about our 88-acre farm and how we grow our organic olives\, apples\, and citrus. You will also have a chance to stroll through the orchard and meet Mark Marthaler\, who will explain his inspiration for the Apple Trolley. He will show you where he produces his other art—including the giant apples and vibrant butterflies dotted across our farm – and share his design secrets and inspiration that turned a simple orchard ride into a living piece of art. \nYour ticket Includes: \nA guided journey through the orchard on our Apple Trolley.\nAn exclusive artist meet-and-greet with artist Mark Marthaler.\nStraus vanilla ice cream topped with Gold Ridge Organic Farms Apple Cider Syrup or Meyer Lemon Citrus Oil.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/ultimate-apple-trolley-experience-at-gold-ridge-organic-farms/2026-10-17/1/
LOCATION:Gold Ridge Organic Farms\, 3387 Canfield Rd\, Sebastopol\, 95472
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Trolley-for-Ticketspice-scaled.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Gold Ridge Organic Farms":MAILTO:info@goldridgeorganicfarms.com
END:VEVENT
