SUMMARY:Fruit Wine Making Workshop
DESCRIPTION:The Sebastopol Grange Presents: Fruit Winemaking\nLearn how to make wines from apples\,\napricots\, berries\, nectarines\, peaches\,\npears\, persimmons\, plums and even\nlemons!\nPresenter: Vi Epperson\, an amateur\nwinemaker since 2014 who has produced\nover 800 bottles of wine. She uses a non-tech\nkitchen-oriented approach to\nwinemaking. If you can follow a recipe\, you\ncan learn to make wine. She will\ndemonstrate the preparation\, home\nequipment\, ingredients\, fermentation\nsteps\, bottling and labeling of fruit wines.\nWinetasting will follow ( must be 21). \n6000 Sebastopol Road
