SUMMARY:AGVWC Fall Quarterly Gathering
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Sonoma County Fungi 101! In his talk\, David Healy of the Sonoma County Mycology Association will introduce some basic mushroom vocabulary\, talk about 4 trees that host mushrooms in Sonoma County\, and discuss some of the most important mushrooms that grow in our area. Feel free to bring in mushroom specimens for ID help.
